          "jcr:created": "Sat Jan 26 2019 01:48:39 GMT+0000",
          "text": "<p><span class=\"fontsize-2em\"><span class=\"futura-bold\">Ease of removal<sup>3</sup><br>\n </span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><span class=\"urw-egyptienne\">Patented screw/plate interface&nbsp;designed for&nbsp;consistent screw insertion and helps ease extraction<sup>3</sup><br>\n </span></span><br>\n</span></p>\n<p><span class=\"fontsize-2em\"><span class=\"urw-egyptienne\"><span style=\"color: #ffb500;\">•</span> Conically shaped screw head&nbsp;</span></span></p>\n<p><span class=\"fontsize-2em\"><span class=\"urw-egyptienne\"><span style=\"color: #ffb500;\">•</span>&nbsp;Rounded threads&nbsp;</span></span></p>\n<p><span class=\"fontsize-2em\"><span class=\"urw-egyptienne\"><span style=\"color: #ffb500;\">•</span>&nbsp;One free thread path&nbsp;</span></span></p>\n<p><span class=\"fontsize-2em\"><span class=\"urw-egyptienne\"><span style=\"color: #ffb500;\">•</span>&nbsp;Type II anodization</span></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span class=\"fontsize-2em\"><span class=\"futura-bold\">Universal hole design</span><br>\n <span class=\"urw-egyptienne\">Cortical screw angulation</span></span></p>\n<p><span class=\"fontsize-2em\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span class=\"fontsize-2em\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n",
          "jcr:lastModified": "Mon Aug 17 2020 18:21:14 GMT+0000",
